# NO-TRACKING environment for the bashy k3s verified build.
# Shell-sourceable; shipped as a release asset so a launcher applies exactly
# what this build was gated against. See builds/k3s/README.md.
#
# Usage: set -a; . bashy-build/no-tracking.env; set +a
#
# k3s has NO update checker and NO usage reporting. Its outbound surface is
# what a cluster is configured to reach: image pulls (the agent's pause image
# and workload images), and the add-ons upstream deploys from its embedded
# manifests. This build embeds only the image-free manifests, so a bare server
# deploys nothing that pulls an image.
#
# Go's net/http honours the proxy environment, so an operator shell that
# exports a proxy would hand the service an egress path it never asked for.
# Clearing all of them and allowing only loopback in NO_PROXY closes that door.
HTTP_PROXY=
HTTPS_PROXY=
http_proxy=
https_proxy=
ALL_PROXY=
all_proxy=
NO_PROXY=127.0.0.1,::1,localhost
no_proxy=127.0.0.1,::1,localhost
